= Scope and intent

This changelog records substantive revisions to the NDT framework manuscript.
It distinguishes changes in prose or architecture from new empirical evidence
and preserves negative or bounded findings that constrain the theory.

= Changelog

== 2026-08-07: Neurocomputational integration and claim-boundary revision

- Preserved Tier-1 scope as Minimal-MNDM, functional RVC, and MNPS. Simulator
  audits, subsystem theory, NDT-Q, EAP, and metabolic material are explicitly
  Tier-2 extensions or companion programmes.
- Added a truth-known simulator appendix section. Its recovery results are
  described as synthetic estimator audits; aggregate reachability calibration
  is retained while the failed directional Gate R claim is retained as a
  rejection. No simulator Jacobian is equated with empirical MNJ.
- Added subsystem sections for CCTG and HELS. CCTG is a speculative
  context-conditional transition-field account; HELS has validated
  infrastructure but no validated landscape-writing mechanism.
- Added NDT-Q content sections as an operational content/readout architecture.
  The revision explicitly rejects fibre-topology, quale-measurement, and
  mouse-phenomenology interpretations.
- Separated functional RVC from the proposed TRN--VG mechanism. Following
  Zenodo 21774408, the manuscript now records a bounded PV-linked MGB
  population-dimensionality result and states that full TRN--VG, single-unit
  variance gating, SOM equivalence, and TRN-to-$sigma(t)$ identification are
  not validated.
- Recast the TRN conductance-to-variance relation as a simulation sensitivity
  ansatz with no empirically identified $kappa$.
- Preserved EAP formal equations as Tier-2 targets while adding an empirical
  status bridge: wake task-phase co-modulation and carrier-specific RichSleep
  timing are constrained observational results, not causal entrainment.
- Added the paired hypoglycemia--euglycemia result as a metabolic perturbation
  boundary: stratified MNPS shifts are retained, while reachability collapse,
  metabolic EAP gating, and consciousness-level interpretation are not
  supported.
- Replaced the previous mis-copied S4 clinical-template placeholder with this
  actual changelog and added a status-marked glossary.
